# Insights / social OG

LinkedIn ignores SVG. Blank Playwright rasters (~4KB) have shipped before. Same-path PNG under year-long `immutable` sticks forever.

## Defaults (no ceremony)

1. `ogImage` = raster (`.png` / `.jpg` / `.webp`), never `.svg`.
2. Build via the OG script (or `scripts/pbj_og_raster.py` helpers). **If the script exits non-zero, do not commit.** Do not hand-wave a “successful” blank write.
3. Replacing a previously deployed OG at the same path → bump `ogImage` `?v=` (or rename). In-place overwrite alone is not enough after `immutable` cache.
4. Root `-og.png` must not use year-long `immutable` (see `_static_cache_headers` + `cache_control` clear).

## Prompt → ship

- “Fix LinkedIn / OG / push” = regenerate raster + meta + selective commit/push. Title/CSS only if the same message asks.
- Dirty tree: selective `git add` (see `pbj320-clean-hotfix`). No worktree for PNG/meta-only.

## After push (one curl)

`Content-Length` on the live `ogImage` URL must match the real PNG. Then LinkedIn Post Inspector once.
